Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but\Nyou're definitely not normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Riff!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make short work of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another playing card?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Joestar, welcome to our abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the butler of this\Nmansion you may call me Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby huh yes I am the younger\NDarby it might interest you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to know the Darby whom you\Ndefeated upon your arrival was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my older brother so there\Nisn't just one so loud in the
