Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, he just brought out his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since we've seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, his stand is\Nphysically showing itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you decide who\Nshall be my first opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if we'd listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.78,0:02:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, take this weirdo down.
