Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wager that Star\NPlatinum's first attack will...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be with his left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and it'll be a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much would you care to bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which arm doesn't matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One punch will finish it. Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.36,0:02:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him have it already, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoorah!
