Dialogue: 2,0:03:01.49,0:03:01.53,SFXPurple2,3,0,0,0,,{=4}{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(780.2,118.8)\frz11.77\4a&HFF&}Boom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His speed is insane! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a bit of bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, it appears as\Nthough I've lost the bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like my brother, I also enjoy a round of\Ngambling, but luck is never on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to take you to a\Nwonderful world to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? A bit? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all subterfuge! Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's falling into the abyss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get him out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more the merrier and all that, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar cocky we know it's too\Ndangerous for us to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me if you\Ndon't hear from us in 10
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,minutes Torch the mansion\Ndo you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn it to the ground Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.14,0:04:11.23,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(753,855)\pos(146,877)}Episode 40: D'Arby the Player, Part 1 {Ik it says Player but come on man, D'Arby the Gambler and D'Arby the Gamer is too good to not be used}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this an illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we still above ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or did he pull us under?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this stuff is really an\Nillusion, they've got watered down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stuff feels so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this guy\Ntrying to accomplish here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See if you can figure out his ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It knew without a doubt that I\Nwould throw a right-handed punch.
