Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can't figure it out soon,\Nwe're gonna lose, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you care to wet your whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're real, and I assure\Nyou they're not poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cross my heart and hope to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just answer this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we inside the mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the mansion are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you that. The basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this illusion the\Nwork of a stand's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is all this the doing of your stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it Dio's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose stand, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would rather not reveal that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Speedwagon Foundation has reported\Nthere are two to three more stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that accurate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not reveal that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're about as helpful\Nas a cramp in a relay race.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it means so much, I could lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unlike my dearly defeated brother, I\Nprefer not to resort to petty trickery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me make sure I've got this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying if we don't defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we won't be able to get\Nback to the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've pieced it together, good sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That obnoxious gentlemanly demeanor is\Nbeginning to wear thin on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be forgetting\Nthat it's three against one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're short on time, so you'll have to\Ndeal with all of us attacking at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take a load off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on what\NI have to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your collection?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much like my brother, I'm what you\Nmight call a humble collector of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, thinking about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all collectors must yearn to share their\Ntreasures for that moment of praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could he possibly\Nbe doing with these toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:06:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, this guy is Darby's brother, so\NI'm guessing those aren't ordinary dolls.
