Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby, talk to me, please\Ntalk, why won't you talk to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby, talk to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,god?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're alive, how is that even\Npossible, bastard, you took their souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously as making dolls is my hobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but of course ordinary doll makers cannot\Nimbue their handiwork with human souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I may be giving too much\Naway, but that's my Stan's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comparatively my brother's collection of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,simple coins made of souls\Nis rather uninspired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my collection you can play\Ndress up and have actual chats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me show you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.54,0:07:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little showstopper is named Sonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.36,0:08:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can wax poetic about her passionate\Nlove stories Such exquisite skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone would be proud to own her. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elliot is a serial killer\Nwith a victim count of eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll tell you all about\Nthe patients he's killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made the glasses and stethoscope myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I nearly forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like for you to meet Tatsuhiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's a game expert from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This brilliant young man was a\Nformidable opponent with an IQ of 190.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you, it wasn't easy beating\Nthis little guy and stealing his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just as messed up in\Nthe head as your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're more sadistic\Nthan your brother ever was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to see what your parents were like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of patience with\Nthis sociopath's puppet show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm fairly certain you\Nlearned this when you fought my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the human soul can be\Na rather mysterious entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment a person admits defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:09:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their inner spirit dies, and the\Nsoul loses almost all vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that moment, I have the power\Nto rip the soul from the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the fundamental\Nmechanism of our stance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show and tell is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna beat you to a bloody\Npulp and get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, listen to what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely, the fact that you're under my\Ncontrol hasn't escaped your notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I recall,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were quite shocked when I knew exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which arm you were\Ngoing to attack me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from where I'm standing, it seems\Nyou still haven't figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were shaken by my prowess and I was\Nable to give your soul a little love tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think I did\Nwhen I touched your soul?
