Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell did you do to his arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done nothing but embed a\Ntomb's hand inside Jotaro's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could crush your\Nright arm with a thought
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in doing so make\NMaster Dio very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to\Ndefend myself against
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin and Joseph and\Nwould most certainly perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we wouldn't want that to\Nhappen, would we, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So here's a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let's play a game\Nwith our souls as collateral.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you defeat me, I solemnly\Nswear to release Jotaro's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So according to you, I'm\Nalready under your control.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have news for you, Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret picking a\Nfight with me and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, your righteous\Nanger is all well and good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'd rather hear you say the\Nwords, I'll bet my soul on this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I have another\Nrequest if you'd indulge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, you shall be my first opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.28,0:10:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fight is with me, buddy, so don't\Ntry and pass the buck to Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Kakyoin is decidedly not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer Kakyoin not back\Nout of our arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And attack me with his stand after\NI've taken both of your souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,due to lack of familial attachment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this arrogant prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks this challenge is going\Nto be a walk in the park for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want,\Nthen I will be your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what? Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really not too concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've probably played more video\Ngames than anyone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I officially accept your challenge\Nand choose F Mega as our game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll wager my soul!
