Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.38,0:11:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll wager my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.82,0:11:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick Wing, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you\Nto take this guy on first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still don't have a\Ngrasp on that spirit hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could hinder your game-playing ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do I have your guarantee\Nthat you'll release
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro from your stand's\Npower if you lose the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
