Dialogue: 2,0:12:22.59,0:12:22.63,SFXPurple3 - Copy,6.2,0,0,0,,{=11}{\bord0\blur0.7\pos(961.434,18.001)\fade(255,0,255,-2630,-2629,39,40)\4a&HFF&}Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The TV console and game\Ncartridges are all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I can tell, this\Nis just an ordinary setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep trying to tell you that\NI'm not a cheater like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're ready, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.98,0:12:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,F★Mega!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Select your car!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and select your vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've decided to go with number 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll be number 15,\Nas my birthday is January 5th.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can begin at your leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with the courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start the game already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.00,0:13:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Race starts in five!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's button-mashing the\Naccelerator at an incredible speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going for a Tribe start! Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to try the Sing tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.50,0:13:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he just cut me off. As\Nlong as I'm in the lead, he
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't beat me and I've made\Nit impossible for him to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pass it's unfortunate I\Nknow but the simple truth is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never make a mistake during a\NVictory will be mine, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, you've played this\Ngame before, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not reveal that. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your chance, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your machine back on course and\Nstart kicking this bastard's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:14:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.24,0:15:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One doesn't simply get those skills\Nby playing video games! Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never could have\Nimagined that someone as
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,measured as Kakyoin would\Nmake such a bold move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the way to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neck and neck! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look carefully, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin's at the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to those turns,\Nhe's at a major disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,355 kmh, now it's 358, and now 360,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three seconds until the first turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no way I can\Nmake it going this fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.32,0:15:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm entering the turn at full speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are hitting the\Nturns the exact same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too close to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:15:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've intrigued me, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your soul on the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've conquered your fear and become\Nthe picture of unwavering resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare say you'll make a worthy\Naddition to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is for me to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin thought to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I've conquered my fears, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long road.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six months ago, I had the unfortunate\Nexperience of meeting your master, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was terrified when he implanted\None of his flesh buds in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My memories of that day\Nare as clear as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember the horror I felt in\Nmy soul as I faced that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My legs wouldn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every hair on my body stood on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.26,0:16:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I was frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was helpless, completely at his mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mere sight of Dio was enough\Nto turn my own body against itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach was in knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so close to vomiting, I could\Ntaste bile in the back of my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio gazed down at me, and, as if\Ntenderly calming a frightened child,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he said, Easy, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing for you to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be friends, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still curse myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard his words and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I felt all of my anxiety melt away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was completely and utterly relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought, I still have a chance to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive him for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll never forgive myself for\Nsubmitting to that bastard's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My weakness will forever\Nbe my greatest failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro saved me from that hell, which\Nis why I've come on this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never again allow\Nmyself to be such a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that, Darby, is why I'm able to fight\Nyou even with my very soul on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:17:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're neck and neck again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rounding the third corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why, on this day, I vow that I,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noriaki Kakyoin, will never be\Ncontrolled by my fears again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.26,0:18:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My word is my bond! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the fifth corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're back in sync!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, they're turning at the same speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Kakyoin! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.84,0:18:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sixth corner is coming up fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, the speed\Ntunnel comes right after turn six.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you enter that tunnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're granted a boost that can\Ndouble your max speed to 850 kmh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure I get to that tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the thing is, the tunnel's\Nonly wide enough for one car.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they try to enter the tunnel side\Nby side, one of them is going to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.54,0:18:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the sixth turn, and\Nthey're still neck and neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, push him out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you realized it yet, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have the power to push me aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't believe me, why not\Nglance at your handy-dandy power meter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hakui, you have less power than he does!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You used up your power\Nwhen you spun around and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blocked me back at the\Nbeginning of the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't the best move on your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're regretting that decision now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.32,0:19:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two seconds till the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can let this fool have the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get behind him to avoid\Ncrashing right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he makes it to the tunnel first, my\Nchances of winning go to absolute zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second left till victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cocaine!
