Dialogue: 2,0:19:43.41,0:19:43.49,SFXOang,7,0,0,0,,{=21}{\bord0\blur0.6\frz358.5\pos(1358.57,827.51)\4a&HFF&}Grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got the car up on two wheels!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How absurd you're riding the tunnel walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes you've got this in the\Nbed Kakyoin just hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little bit further and\Nvictory will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now push him aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet I'm concentrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out he's slamming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes no difference to\Nme if I lose some power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only concern is getting around\Nthat turn faster than Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it's only by a\Nhundredth of a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one one-thousandth\Nof a millimeter ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't see the cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on out, we have to get through\Nthe tunnel in almost absolute darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is my radar\Nwill be completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are eight turns, a landmine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.70,0:20:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a cannon attack waiting to\Nput us through our paces up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This area will remain\Ndark until we make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mistake and I'll slam into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But fortunately for us, I already\Nknow exactly where each turn is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby knows, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.80,0:20:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cars are beginning to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell who's ahead or where\Nthey are in that blasted tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, two, and one. Cannon attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a second there, the\Nblast lit up the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that cocky-o-ing\Nis running slightly behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're about to exit the tunnel.
