Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.08,0:23:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never be foolish enough\Nto let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.66,0:23:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weaker car loses in a collision.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.54,0:23:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This all belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be kicking this guy's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.88,0:23:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're playing baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.08,0:23:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just back out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.90,0:23:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the worst pep\Ntalk I've ever heard.
